      ],
      "takeaway_fil": "Ang pagwawasto ay may pinagmulan; ang kulang ay hindi pa tiyak hangga’t walang angkop na beripikasyon.",
      "takeaway_en": "A correction keeps its source; a gap stays unconfirmed until suitable verification is available.",
